.TH DMT 1 "@BUILD_DATE@" "dmt @PROJECT_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dmt \- Debian Mirror Tester
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dmt
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Measure the download speed and latency of various Debian mirrors.
.B dmt
provides an easy way to determine which mirrors are most optimal for your connection.
It reads the Debian official mirror list to build a set of valid servers, and filters
them based on user-provided options if necessary. After testing, it will show a ranking
of the fastest mirrors based on time to start transfer, as well as a ranking of the fastest
mirrors based on download speed. 

Results depend on many factors, and can be highly variable depending on your location, time
of day, what your local ISP is doing, 
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-country \fICODE\fR
Filter mirrors by ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code (e.g., US, GB, FR).
Only tests mirrors located in the specified country.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-official\-mirrors
Exclude debian.org mirrors from testing. Tests only community mirrors.
.TP
.B \-\-only\-official\-mirrors
Test only official debian.org mirrors. Ignores community mirrors.
Can be combined with
.B \-\-country
to test official mirrors in a specific country.
.TP
.B \-\-count \fINUMBER\fR
Number of top results to display for latency and speed rankings.
Default is 5 results.
To disable this option (display all results), provide a very large number.
.TP
.B \-\-timeout \fIMILLISECONDS\fR
Set the timeout for individual mirror requests, in milliseconds.
Default is 60 seconds (60000 ms).
To disable this option (wait indefinitely for a response), provide a very large number.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Display the help message and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
Test all mirrors and show top 5 fastest:
.IP
dmt
.PP
Test only mirrors in France:
.IP
dmt \-\-country FR
.PP
Test only official Debian mirrors in Germany:
.IP
dmt \-\-only\-official\-mirrors \-\-country DE
.PP
Test community mirrors and show top 10 results:
.IP
dmt \-\-no\-official\-mirrors \-\-count 10
.PP
Test with a custom timeout of 5 seconds:
.IP
dmt \-\-timeout 5000
.SH AUTHOR
sukibaby
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/sukibaby/dmt
.SH COPYRIGHT
This project, dmt, is licensed under the MIT license.
dmt uses libcurl (https://curl.se/libcurl/). .PP
